"""Recipes for the Little Road family-car field (AI entrants). Original designs.

Blender units: metres, +Y is the nose, Z up, ground at z=0. Each recipe is read by
build_family_cars.py. Body shape never affects performance (equipment does).

shell: stations (y, half-width, sill z, top z), rear to front, Hermite-interpolated.
shape: superellipse exponents (x, z); lower is boxier, .5+ is bubbly.
glass: greenhouse outer frame. wb/wr = base/roof half-width, roof = outer roof z,
       yf0/yf1 = windscreen base/top y, yr1/yr0 = rear screen top/base y,
       pillars = pillar y positions (B, C...), quarter = 'glass' | 'panel' (vans).
"""

